Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Windows-style new-network firewall zone prompting
 ZoneGuard watches NetworkManager for newly joined networks. The first
 time it sees one, it locks the interface to a restrictive firewalld
 zone and prompts the user to pick the real profile (home, work,
 public, ...) instead of silently reusing whatever zone was set up for
 a different network.
 .
 Includes zoneguard-daemon (the background watcher) and
 zoneguard-config (a settings GUI for daemon control, known networks,
 and editing firewalld profiles directly).
